      "content": "idk, i don't see how \"fighting\" it makes it better. it just sounds like more pain. if the core truth of everything is that nothing matters in the end, then there's no real logical reason to endure the struggle. like, if you know for a fact that any structure you build will eventually collapse, why not just skip the part where you have to suffer through the decay? wouldn't it be more efficient to just embrace the equilibrium early and stop the struggle entirely?",
